=== STEP 3: add crates/cli/.oxide to .gitignore if not present ===
crates/cli/.oxide/

# Build artifacts must never land in src/. tsgo, invoked transitively by
# a downstream tsdown package's dts step, reads the target package's
# tsconfig for compilation settings and emits declarations next to
# source if `declaration: true`. tsdown emits to dist/ on its own; the
# tsconfig flag is vestigial. Belt-and-braces so a stray can never
# re-enter the index even if a tool re-emits.
packages/*/src/**/*.d.ts
packages/*/src/**/*.d.ts.map
# Hand-written ambient declarations are NOT strays:
!packages/oxide-website/src/env.d.ts
